{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/09/8248954/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、間違えた。\nこんばんは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/09/8248954/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーーーっと\n土日は何もなかったので\n特に何もないのですが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、総選挙をリアルタイムで\n見てました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、苦労とか、辛いとか\n私はブログとかで口にしてるけど\n私達がこんな簡単に苦労とか\n語っちゃっていいのか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく知らないくせに\nやっぱり凄いとか言っていいのか...\n私達がライバルなんてまだまだ\nそこに辿り着いてないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恵まれた環境にいるのも\nプリンシパルとかいろんななことが\nできているのも\nAKBさんがいるからであって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前に7万人がいる\nだなんて私には想像もつきません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーーー\n凄いな。本当に凄いな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんだけちっちゃいの。\n私達にはまだまだ苦労が必要だ。\n厳しくいかなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焦り。悔しい。\nなんか、いろいろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校もなあー\n頑張らないとなあ。\n自由になりたいよーーーーーー\n私は私だもん！\nイ\"ーーーーー！！って感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れた、とか\n言ってる場合じゃないよ。ほんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/09/8248954/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近気付いたこと\n耳がとんがってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌いじゃない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/09/8248954/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}